            <Usage notes="Gauged beyond AMAX3. Fits to gaugings in non-modular range with high flow rating from modelling confirmed by gauging. Still some uncertainty in June 2007 peak flow but reasonably high confidence in other AMAX flows." suitable="Yes" type="Pooling"/>
